    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"16. Hydrophone Models\"\n---\n\n\nOcean Networks Canada uses piezoelectric hydrophones from several manufacturers and distributors: the main ones being *Ocean Sonics* and *JASCO Applied Sciences*.\n\nMost hydrophones are Ocean Sonics icListen smart hydrophones: icListen HF (High Frequency; 10 Hz to 200k Hz), and icListen AF (Audio Frequency; 10 Hz to 12 kHz).\nJASCO provides Geospectrum-manufactured hydrophones for multi-element directional arrays, great for localizing sources.\n\n````{=html}\n<div style=\"\n  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65); \n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px); \n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); \n  border-radius: 12px; \n  padding: 24px 28px; \n  color: #f8fafc; \n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n  max-width: 850px;\n  margin: 20px auto;\n\">\n\n  <!-- Header & Subtitle -->\n  <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-bottom: 12px;\">\n    <div>\n      <span style=\"text-transform: uppercase; tracking-spacing: 0.05em; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; display: block; margin-bottom: 2px;\">Instrument Bandwidth Spectrum</span>\n      <h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; border: none;\">ONC Hydrophones Frequency Coverage</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 500;\">0.1 Hz &mdash; 200 kHz Range</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Spectrum Bars List -->\n  <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n\n    <!-- Item 1 -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr 110px; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #f1f5f9;\">\n        icListen HF <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; color: #94a3b8; display: block;\">Ocean Sonics</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); height: 10px; border-radius: 99px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 15%; right: 0%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8); border-radius: 99px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(56,189,248,0.4);\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #38bdf8; text-align: right; font-mono: true;\">10 Hz &ndash; 200 kHz</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Item 2 -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr 110px; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #f1f5f9;\">\n        icListen AF <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; color: #94a3b8; display: block;\">Ocean Sonics</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); height: 10px; border-radius: 99px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 15%; right: 35%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8); border-radius: 99px;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #38bdf8; text-align: right;\">10 Hz &ndash; 12 kHz</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Item 3 -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr 110px; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #f1f5f9;\">\n        icListen LF <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; color: #94a3b8; display: block;\">Ocean Sonics</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); height: 10px; border-radius: 99px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 0%; right: 55%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8); border-radius: 99px;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #38bdf8; text-align: right;\">0.1 Hz &ndash; 1.6 kHz</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Item 4 -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr 110px; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #f1f5f9;\">\n        M36-V35-100 <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; color: #94a3b8; display: block;\">GeoSpectrum / JASCO</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); height: 10px; border-radius: 99px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 15%; right: 15%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6366f1, #818cf8); border-radius: 99px;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #818cf8; text-align: right;\">1 Hz &ndash; 200 kHz</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Item 5 -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr 110px; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #f1f5f9;\">\n        M8E-51-C35 <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; color: #94a3b8; display: block;\">GeoSpectrum / JASCO</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); height: 10px; border-radius: 99px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 8%; right: 25%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6366f1, #818cf8); border-radius: 99px;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #818cf8; text-align: right;\">10 kHz &ndash; 200 kHz</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Legend & Footer -->\n  <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n      <span style=\"width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #38bdf8; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;\"></span>\n      Ocean Sonics\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n      <span style=\"width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #818cf8; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;\"></span>\n      GeoSpectrum / JASCO\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n````\n\n\n\n# Model technical specs\n\nThe table shows the technical specs for hydrophone models ONC uses most.\n\n::: {#2908081e .cell execution_count=1}\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display}\n```{=html}\n<script type=\"ojs-define\">{\"contents\": [{\"name\": \"specs_data\", \"value\": [{\"Manufacturer\": \"Device\", \"JASCO\": \"GeoSpectrum M36-V35-100\", \"JASCO.1\": \"GeoSpectrum M8E-51-C35\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"Ocean Sonics icListen LF\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"Ocean Sonics icListen HF\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"Ocean Sonics icListen AF\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Type\", \"JASCO\": \"Wide-band, omnidirectional, piezoelectric, AMAR\", \"JASCO.1\": \"High-Frequency,\\nelement/array, piezoelectric\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"Low-frequency, omnidirectional, piezoelectric\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"High-Frequency, omnidirectional, piezoelectric\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"Low-frequency, omnidirectional, piezoelectric\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Length (with connector) [mm]\", \"JASCO\": \"198 mm\", \"JASCO.1\": \"88 mm\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"230 mm\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"258 mm\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"256 mm\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Diameter [mm]\", \"JASCO\": \"33 mm\", \"JASCO.1\": \"22 mm\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"45 mm\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"48 mm\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"48 mm\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Weight [in air/in seawater]\", \"JASCO\": \"--\", \"JASCO.1\": \"--\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"--\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"--\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"1045/686 g\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Battery life (approx.)\", \"JASCO\": \"--\", \"JASCO.1\": \"--\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"8 h\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"8 h\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"8 h\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Sampling Rate\", \"JASCO\": \"16 - 250 kS/s\", \"JASCO.1\": \"128 kS/s\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"250 - 4000 S/s\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"1 - 512 kS/s\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"1 - 32 kS/s\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Sensitivity (w/ pre-amp)\", \"JASCO\": \"-165 +/- 1\", \"JASCO.1\": \"-165 +/- 1.5\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"--\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": -173, \"Ocean Sonics.2\": -169}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Depth rating\", \"JASCO\": \"2500 m\", \"JASCO.1\": \"200 - 1500 m\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"3500 m\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"3500 m\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"900, 3500 m\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Frequency Range\", \"JASCO\": \"1 Hz - 200 kHz\", \"JASCO.1\": \"10 kHz - 200 kHz\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"0.1 - 1600 Hz (infrasound)\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"10 Hz - 200 kHz (effective up to 128 kHz)\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"10 Hz - 12 kHz\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Operating Temperatures\", \"JASCO\": \"0\\u00b0C to +35\\u00b0C\", \"JASCO.1\": \"-40 to +70 \\u00b0C\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"-5 to +35\\u00b0C\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"-5 to +35\\u00b0C\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"-5 to +35\\u00b0C\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Max Humidity\", \"JASCO\": \"--\", \"JASCO.1\": \"--\", \"Ocean Sonics\": 0.5, \"Ocean Sonics.1\": 0.5, \"Ocean Sonics.2\": 0.5}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Storage Capacity\", \"JASCO\": \"--\", \"JASCO.1\": \"--\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"1 TB\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"1 TB\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"1 TB\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Current Draw\", \"JASCO\": \"1.3 mA (at 6.8 VDC)\\n4.2 mA with current signalling pre-amp\", \"JASCO.1\": \"1/3 mA at 6.8 VDC\\n4.2 mA with currency signalling mode\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"--\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"--\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"--\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Input Voltage\", \"JASCO\": \"6.8 VDC nominal\\n4.5-30 V operational\", \"JASCO.1\": \"6.8 VDC nominal\\n4.5-30 V operational\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"12-24 VDC\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"48V (36 V recommended)\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"48V (36 V recommended)\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Power (min, typical, max)\", \"JASCO\": \"--\", \"JASCO.1\": \"--\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"(1.83, 2.26, 3.75)\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"(1.83, 2.26, 3.75)\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"(1.83, 2.26, 3.75)\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Communication Interface\", \"JASCO\": \"Ethernet\", \"JASCO.1\": \"Ethernet\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"Ethernet\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"Ethernet\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"Ethernet\"}, {\"Manufacturer\": \"Connector Type\", \"JASCO\": \"Subconn MCBH8-M\", \"JASCO.1\": \"SubConn MCOM8-M\", \"Ocean Sonics\": \"SubConn MCBH8-M\", \"Ocean Sonics.1\": \"Subconn MCBH8-M\", \"Ocean Sonics.2\": \"Subconn MCBH8-M\"}]}]}</script>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n```{ojs}\n//| echo: false\n\nall_cols = specs_data.length > 0 ? Object.keys(specs_data[0]) : []\nlabel_col = all_cols[0] || \"\"\nmodel_cols = all_cols.slice(1)\ndeviceRow = specs_data[0] || {}\nspecRows = specs_data.slice(1).filter(row => row[label_col] && row[label_col] !== \"--\")\n\nhtml`\n<div class=\"specs-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"specs-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Model\\n / Distributor</th>\n        ${model_cols.map(m => {\n          const deviceName = deviceRow[m] && deviceRow[m] !== \"--\" ? deviceRow[m] : m.split(\".\")[0];\n          const brand = m.split(\".\")[0];\n          return html`<th><span class=\"spec-device\">${deviceName}</span><span class=\"spec-brand\">${brand}</span></th>`;\n        })}\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      ${specRows.map(row => html`\n        <tr>\n          <td>${row[label_col]}</td>\n          ${model_cols.map(m => {\n            const val = row[m];\n            return html`<td class=\"${val === \"--\" ? \"spec-empty\" : \"\"}\">${val}</td>`;\n          })}\n        </tr>\n      `)}\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n`\n```\n\n\n# Vendors\n\n::: {.vendor-grid}\n\n::: {.vendor}\n[![](../images/jasco-logo.png){lightbox=false}](https://www.jasco.com/)\n\n### JASCO Applied Sciences {.unlisted .unnumbered}\nA scientific consulting firm and equipment supplier specializing in underwater acoustics.\nFounded by Joseph Arnold Scrimger in Victoria, British Columbia, in 1981, the company now has its largest primary operations office in Halifax, Nova Scotia, Canada.\n\nJASCO operates globally across national defence, marine environmental stewardship, oil and gas asset monitoring, and academic research.\nThey also perform acoustic modelling, field data collection, and advanced analysis suites.\n\nTheir *Autonomous Multichannel Acoustic Recorder (AMAR)* provides passive acoustic data acquisition with high bandwidth and low noise.\n\nTheir hydrophones are manufactured by GeoSpectrum Technologies Inc.\n:::\n\n::: {.vendor}\n[![](../images/geospectrum-logo.png){lightbox=false}](https://www.geospectrum.ca/)\n\n### GeoSpectrum Technologies Inc. (GTI) {.unlisted .unnumbered}\nA specialized Canadian aerospace and defence company, based in Halifax, NS, that focuses on the design, engineering, and manufacturing of underwater acoustic transducers and specialized systems.\nGeoSpectrum hydrophones are high-performance, and frequently deployed as part of hydrophone arrays managed by JASCO.\n:::\n\n::: {.vendor}\n[![](../images/oceansonics-logo.png){lightbox=false}](https://oceansonicsinc.com/)\n\n### Ocean Sonics {.unlisted .unnumbered}\nOcean Sonics is a canadian, Nova Scotia-based pioneer in the development of smart digital hydrophones, found in 2005.\nThey have developed both low-frequency (icListenLF/AF) and high-frequency (icListenHF) hydrophones.\n:::\n\n::: {.vendor}\n[![](../images/wildlife-acoustics-logo.png){lightbox=false}](https://www.wildlifeacoustics.com/)\n\n### Wildlife Acoustics {.unlisted .unnumbered}\nA US-based private company based in Maynar, MA specialized provider of bioacoustics monitoring technology founded in 2003 by Ian Agranat.\nTheir primary focus is on designing autonomous underwater recorders and sound analysis software for ecosystem biodiversity monitoring, environmental assessments, and wildlife presence/absence surveys.\n\nTheir hydrophone Song Meter SM2M, released in 2011, is designed for long-term autonomous deployments.\n:::\n\n:::\n\n",
